<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT-Paris Miki rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Paris Miki rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research Ltd has assigned Paris Miki Inc a &quot;B&quot; rating, Daiwa Securities brokers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns a &quot;B&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index over the next six months.</p>
</text>
